msgid "Exclude by CSS selector"
msgstr "Välja jätta CSS selektori abil"

#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3706
#: ml-slider-lightbox/class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3706
msgid ""
"CSS selectors for elements to exclude from gallery window (one per line). "
"Examples:<br>.no-lightbox<br>.custom-gallery img<br>#sidebar .widget-area"
msgstr ""
"CSS selektorid elementide jaoks, mis tuleks galerii aknast välja jätta (üks "
"reas). Näited:<br>.no-lightbox<br>.custom-gallery img<br>#sidebar "
".widget-area"

#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3729
#: dist/ml-slider-lightbox/class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3541
#: dist/ml-slider-lightbox/ml-slider-lightbox/class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3541
#: ml-slider-lightbox/class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3729
msgid "Minimum Image Width"
msgstr "Minimaalne pildi laius"

#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3732
#: ml-slider-lightbox/class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3732
msgid ""
"Skip images narrower than this width (in pixels). Uses the displayed width, "
"not the actual image file size. This is helpful for excluding small icons, "
"badges, and buttons."
msgstr ""
"Jätke välja pildid, mille laius on väiksem kui see (pikslites). Kasutab "
"kuvatavat laiust, mitte tegelikku pildifaili suurust. See on kasulik "
"väikeste ikoonide, märkide ja nuppude välja jätmiseks."

#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3755
#: dist/ml-slider-lightbox/class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3567
#: dist/ml-slider-lightbox/ml-slider-lightbox/class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3567
#: ml-slider-lightbox/class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3755
msgid "Minimum Image Height"
msgstr "Minimaalne pildi kõrgus"

#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3758
#: ml-slider-lightbox/class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3758
msgid ""
"Skip images shorter than this height (in pixels). Uses the displayed "
"height, not the actual image file size. This is helpful for excluding small "
"icons, badges, and buttons."
msgstr ""
"Jätke välja pildid, mille kõrgus on väiksem kui see (pikslites). Kasutab "
"kuvatavat kõrgust, mitte tegelikku pildifaili suurust. See on kasulik "
"väikeste ikoonide, märkide ja nuppude välja jätmiseks."

