msgid ""
"For developers: Add the <code>ml-lightbox-enabled</code> class to enable "
"lightbox on any element containing images."
msgstr ""
"Arendajatele: Lisage <code>ml-lightbox-enabled</code> klass, et lubada "
"lightbox mis tahes elemendil, mis sisaldab pilte."

